    <!-- FASTER Scale Descriptions -->
    <string name="desc_restoration">Accepting life on God’s terms, with trust, grace, mercy, vulnerability, and gratitude.</string>
    <string name="desc_forgetting">Start to believe I can handle things on my own. Denying current feelings, fears and problems.</string>
    <string name="desc_anxiety">A growing background noise of undefined fear; getting energy from emotions. Worrying about things I can’t control.</string>
    <string name="desc_speeding">Trying to out-run the emotions. Driven by productivity/work. Not taking time to feel or pray.</string>
    <string name="desc_ticked_off">Getting adrenaline high on anger and aggression. Resentment building up.</string>
    <string name="desc_exhausted">Loss of physical and emotional energy; coming off the adrenaline high, and onset of depression</string>
    <string name="desc_relapse">Returning to the place you swore you would never go again. Lying and keeping secrets. Total despair.</string>

